rent gen  there are also deluxe and crosstrend  bundles available the open beta will be  available soon and those who pre-order a  digital edition of the game will  actually receive early access to the  campaign for up to a week and warzone  2.0 as always remains free  we got some serious cod fans in the  house at gamespot and a bunch of us will  be playing so sub to this channel follow  us on twitter for our cod takes i mean  cooking up right now i've got a live  stream with the gang as well as some  more expert reacts vids which will go  live on our channel every saturday  as for me personally i just whipped up a  deep dive into battlefield 2042 and if  redemption is even possible for that  game so be sure to pop in and check it  out until next time
 

